#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<!--\n"
"  THIS FILE IS MADE-UP TEST DATA FOR WikiReleasePlanningTest.\n"
"  Every version (98.x / 99.x) and every date (2001 / 2098 / 2099) is invented.\n"
